1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,065
Penlock on Passport Prime, running in the KeyOS simulator.

2
00:00:09,065 --> 00:00:13,553
Every launch opens with a warning about protecting your seed.

3
00:00:13,553 --> 00:00:22,245
Mainnet is a deliberate choice in Settings. This is a small test wallet.

4
00:00:22,245 --> 00:00:34,323
Import: the seed is uploaded as a photo and read on the device.

5
00:00:34,323 --> 00:00:37,872
It reads all 12 words. Words and shares stay hidden in this recording.

6
00:00:37,872 --> 00:00:41,563
The seed becomes three paper shares. Any two can rebuild it.

7
00:00:41,563 --> 00:00:52,060
Two shares are saved as images. The second save warns you first.

8
00:00:52,060 --> 00:01:03,913
Now restore with share 3, then share 1. Any two work, in any order.

9
00:01:03,913 --> 00:01:08,595
Recovered from two shares. The phrase stays hidden.

10
00:01:08,595 --> 00:01:15,872
Spending 999 sats from this seed. You approve the destination, change and fee here.

11
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:20,398
Signed by the seed that two shares rebuilt. Ready to broadcast.

